                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "A simple grinding game.\nRandom enemy grinds while transversing the exit in labyrinth.\nAll for accumulating coins for cultivating the village to upgrade one's inventory.\n\nThe game, tho is \ncoarse, simplistic, with typing format errors.\n\nWasn't exactly bad, just lacking in \ncontent, difficulty, and achievements.\n\nCompared with other similar genre RPG maker games,\nit has way better and sharper graphics, \ncolourful, unique artwork of avatars and enemies, \nan array of companions and inventory,\nsmooth fluidity in transition and controls.\n\n\n\nOverall still playable,\nwhere patience and content expectation are one's own enemy.",
